Bundled third-party code
------------------------
src-tauri/vendor/ejs/ contains the yt-dlp EJS solver 0.8.0
(https://github.com/yt-dlp/ejs, Unlicense), which bundles meriyah 6.1.4
(ISC, https://github.com/meriyah/meriyah) and astring 1.9.0 (MIT,
https://github.com/davidbonnet/astring). Their license texts are in
src-tauri/vendor/ejs/LICENSE and src-tauri/vendor/ejs/BUNDLED-LICENSES.txt
and in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt shipped with every release.

src-tauri/src/potoken/ follows the BotGuard / WebPO protocol as documented by
LuanRT/BgUtils (https://github.com/LuanRT/BgUtils, MIT, Copyright (c) 2024
LuanRT). No BgUtils code is bundled; the driver is an independent implementation.
